    <h2>Privacy Statement</h2>

    <p><i>Last updated: November 2026</i></p>

    <p>We keep it simple: this site fully respects your privacy.</p>

    <h3>No cookies</h3>

    <p>This website does not place a single cookie on your device. Zero. Nada. That is why you do not see a cookie banner here.</p>

    <h3>No logging</h3>

    <p>We do not store server log files. Your IP address, browser, or other data is not stored by us anywhere.</p>

    <h3>Only anonymous statistics</h3>

    <p>We use Plausible Analytics to see how many people visit our site. Plausible is a
        privacy-friendly and open-source alternative to Google Analytics. It does not place cookies, does not store
        IP addresses, and does not collect personal data. The statistics are completely anonymous and aggregated. We only see totals, never individual visitors.
        Want to know more? View the <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible's data policy</a>.</p>

    <h3>No third parties</h3>

    <p>We do not share anything with third parties and do not load external scripts, fonts or images that can track you.
        We fetch the images for videos and podcasts ourselves and serve them from our own server.</p>

    <h3>Playing podcasts</h3>

    <p>When you press play on a podcast, the audio comes straight from the company that hosts the podcast.
        Only at that moment does that company receive your IP address and browser details, just like in any podcast app.
        Their own privacy policy applies, for example the one from
        <a href="https://www.spotify.com/uk/legal/privacy-policy/">Megaphone (Spotify)</a>,
        <a href="https://www.simplecast.com/privacy">Simplecast</a>,
        <a href="https://www.buzzsprout.com/privacy">Buzzsprout</a> or
        <a href="https://transistor.fm/privacy/">Transistor</a>.</p>

    <h3>Links to other sites</h3>

    <p>When you click a link to a blog, video or podcast page, you leave this site and that site’s privacy
        policy applies.</p>

    <h3>Questions?</h3>

    <p>Contact Edwin Martin &lt;<a href="mailto:edwin@webontwikkelaar.nl">edwin@webontwikkelaar.nl</a>&gt;.</p>

